# Coinbase Developer Platform (CDP) API keys for the production x402
# facilitator. When both are set, the app authenticates with the CDP
# facilitator at FACILITATOR_URL (gas sponsorship, mainnet SLA, 1k tx/mo
# free then $0.001/tx). Leave both empty to fall back to the community
# facilitator at https://x402.org/facilitator (no auth, no SLA).
